BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Constitution Celebration '26
DTSTART:20261108T170000
DTEND:20261108T200000
DTSTAMP:20261108T170746Z
UID:e9c1bb210b7d93da0eb366c8a65ed2@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:We're so excited that we'll be able to celebrate our post-elec
 tion unity as Vermonters and Americans. Please join American Civics Snapsh
 ots for our first annual Constitution Day Celebration and Fundraiser at th
 e Burlington Beer Company in Burlington\, Vermont. Spend an evening with f
 riends\, neighbors\, and the civic-minded community for dinner and a viewi
 ng of a historical show as we celebrate the legacy of the U.S. Constitutio
 n. This is a meaningful moment to gather in honor and support of a governm
 ent which has guided our nation for nearly 250 years and has inspired the 
 rule of law around the world. As supporters of democracy\, let's continue 
 to commemorate the 250th Anniversary of the United States. We hope you wil
 l celebrate with us\, reflect on the values that shape our democracy\, and
  help us to bring civics knowledge into communities around the country. Ea
 ch ticket includes appetizers\, dinner\, 2 drink tickets\, and a show. We 
 will also have civics trivia and giveaways!\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Burlington Beer Company\, 180 Flynn Avenue
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/constituti
 on-celebration-26-29-10-2026-11-14-06
END:VEVENT
