DESCRIPTION:Classical guitarist William Ghezzi will perform solo guitar wo
 rks by Bach\, Schenck\, Telemann\, Nin-Culmell\, Olivas\, Ponce\, Lauro\, 
 Carlevaro\, Crespo\, and Villa-Lobos. William Ghezzi has performed widely 
 as soloist\, as well as with orchestras\, chamber ensembles\, choruses\, d
 ance companies\, and theater. He has appeared with the Montpelier Chamber 
 Orchestra\, the Harry Partch Ensemble\, and the Philadelphia Guitar Ensemb
 le\, among many others. His recordings are available on Spotify\, Apple Mu
 sic\, Amazon\, and YouTube Music\, and his performance videos can be seen 
 on YouTube\, Vimeo\, and Instagram. His most recent release\, "Portfolio"
 \, is available on all major streaming platforms. Church of Christ at Dart
